= Investigating Political Violence

The Interior Ministry can investigate armed political groups and attacks on civilians. Each operation must be backed by evidence and accountable police work.

- @right: Investigate violent far-right organizations.
- @left: Investigate violent far-left organizations.
- @accountability: Investigate police cooperation with armed groups.
- @root: Return to government affairs.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@right
on-arrival: grey_wolves_strength *= 0.9; raiders_strength *= 0.9; investigate_far_right += 1; MHP_relation -= 3; MSP_relation -= 3

Investigators pursue attacks and illegal weapons networks linked to far-right organizations.

@left
on-arrival: thkpc_strength *= 0.9; devyol_strength *= 0.9; tkpml_strength *= 0.9; TIP_relation -= 3

Investigators pursue armed attacks and illegal weapons networks linked to far-left organizations.

@accountability
on-arrival: democracystatus += 2; police_loyalty -= 0.05; kurdish_radicalism -= 0.02

Independent investigations examine accusations of police misconduct and cooperation with armed political groups.
